    {
      "id": "5222aeeb",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "## 在**AnyMath**中对信号进行频谱分析 \n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "10d6a2d4",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "在**AnyMath**中，有一种简单的方法可以绘制信号的频谱：在工具栏上的**信号可视化**窗口中，点击**菜单**，并在**选择显示类型**字段中，选择**频域信号**。随后运行该模型，所选信号的频谱将绘制在图形窗口中。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\n![1-4.png](attachment:1-4.png)\n\n</div>\n\n若点击图形窗口工具栏中的 **Settings** 按钮，将打开图形设置窗口。在 **Spectrum Analyzer** 选项卡中，您可以配置内置频谱分析仪的设置：\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\n![1-5.png](attachment:1-5.png)\n\n</div>\n\n要绘制频谱，信号采样数必须至少为$1536$。因此，您必须在模型中选择采样时间（以每秒采样数为单位）和仿真时间（以秒为单位）的数值，使其乘积大于$1536$。\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "1-4.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "1-5.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
