    {
      "id": "ca5541cd",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务1\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0737832d",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "生成一组正态分布的随机数序列。为此，请执行以下步骤：\n\n1. 创建一个新模型。向模型中添加一个**Random Number** 模块。在模块设置窗口中，将**平均值**参数的值设置为`0.0`，**方差**设置为`1.0`，**Sample time**设置为`0.01` s。\n2. 向模型中添加一个**Terminator**。将其连接到**Random Number** 模块的输出端。对输出信号进行记录。\n3. 运行模型。在时域中绘制输出信号。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n该模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![1-6.png](attachment:1-6_2.png)\n\n</center>\n\n噪声信号的波形图：\n\n<center>\n\n![1-7.png](attachment:1-7.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "1-6_2.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "1-7.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
