          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f9731125",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务4\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "25fa1680",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "生成正弦信号的叠加，并绘制其频谱。\n\n1. 创建一个新模型。向模型中添加两个 **Sine Wave** 模块。\n在第一个模块的设置窗口中，将参数值设置为：**Sample time** 为 `0.01` s，**Frequency** 为 `2*π` rad/s，**Amplitude** 为 `1.0`。其余模块参数保留默认值。\n2. 在第二个模块的设置窗口中，将参数值设置为：**Sample time** 为 `0.01` s，**Frequency** 为 `8*π` rad/s，**Amplitude** 为 `0.5`。其余参数保留默认值。\n3. 将 **Add** 模块添加到模型中。将两个 **Sine Wave** 模块的输出连接到 **Add** 模块的输入。\n4. 将 **Terminator** 模块添加到模型中，并将其连接到 **Add** 模块的输出端。记录输出信号。\n5. 将仿真时间设置为 `10` s。\n6. 运行模型。在时域和频域中绘制输出信号。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![1-13.png](attachment:1-13.png)\n\n</center>\n\n两个正弦波之和的波形图：\n\n<center>\n\n![1-14.png](attachment:1-14.png)\n\n</center>\n\n两个正弦波之和的频谱：\n\n<center>\n\n![1-15.png](attachment:1-15.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "1-13.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "1-14.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
        "1-15.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        }
      },
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": false,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
