    {
      "id": "4911b0c9",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️任务5\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d62a22c9",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "使用**啁啾**模块生成一个频率线性变化的啁啾信号。在$10$ s的仿真时间内，振荡频率必须从$0.1$ Hz增加到$20$ Hz。\n\n1. 创建一个新模型。从**信号处理** -\\>**信号源**库中，添加一个**chirp**模块。为**chirp**模块设置以下参数：\n\n   #|\n   ||\n   \n   参数\n\n   |\n   \n  **初始频率（Hz）**\n\n \n   |\n   \n  **目标频率 (Hz)**\n\n \n   |\n   \n  **目标时间 (s)**\n\n   (目标频率变化时间)\n\n   |\n   \n  **扫频时间 (s)**\n\n   (频率变化时间)\n\n   |\n   \n  **Sample time**\n\n   ||\n   ||\n   \n   值\n\n   |\n   \n  `0.1` \n\n   |\n   \n  `20` \n\n   |\n   \n  `10` \n\n   |\n   \n  `10` \n\n   |\n   \n  `0.001` \n\n   ||\n   |#\n   \n   将其余模块参数保留为默认值。\n\n2. 向模型中添加一个**Terminator** 模块。将**Chirp Signal** 模块的输出连接到**Terminator** 模块的输入。记录输出信号。\n3. 将仿真时间设置为`10` s。\n4. 运行模型。在时域和频域中绘制输出信号。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n该模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![1-16.png](attachment:1-16_3.png)\n\n</center>\n\n啁啾信号的波形图：\n\n<center>\n\n![1-17.png](attachment:1-17.png)\n\n</center>\n\n啁啾信号的频谱：\n\n<center>\n\n![1-18.png](attachment:1-18.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {
        "1-16_3.png": {
          "image/png": "data:image/png;base64,"
        },
