    {
      "id": "fe8d26eb",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "### ✏️练习6\n\n"
      ],
      "attachments": {},
      "metadata": {
        "name": "Название секции",
        "engee": {
          "isDisplay": true,
          "isParagraph": true,
          "isClosedParagraph": false,
          "amountHideCellsInside": 0,
          "codeOutputView": "col",
          "codeOutputHidden": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7bfc560e",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "探索**Signal Generator** 模块的功能。使用该模块生成锯齿波和方波信号。绘制这些信号的波形和频谱图。\n\n修改任务5中的模型：\n1. 从模型中移除**Chirp Signal** 模块。\n2. 向模型中添加一个**Signal Generator** 模块。将该模块的输出连接到**Terminator** 模块的输入。\n3. 在**Signal Generator** 模块的设置窗口中，设置以下模块参数：**Amplitude**设为`1.0`，**Frequency**设为`10.0` rad/s，**波形**设为`sawtooth`。\n4. 运行模型。在时域和频域中绘制生成的锯齿波信号。\n7. 在**Signal Generator** 模块的设置窗口中，将参数**Wave form**设置为`Square`。\n8. 再次运行模型。在时域和频域中绘制生成的方波信号。\n\n{% cut \"<h5><span style=\"background-color: #c2ebff\">解法</span></h5>\" %}\n\n该模型：\n\n<center>\n\n![1-19.png](attachment:1-19.png)\n\n</center>\n\n锯齿波信号的波形图：\n\n<center>\n\n![1-20.png](attachment:1-20.png)\n\n</center>\n\n锯齿信号的频谱：\n\n<center>\n\n![1-21.png](attachment:1-21_2.png)\n\n</center>\n\n方波信号的波形图：\n\n<center>\n\n![1-22.png](attachment:1-22.png)\n\n</center>\n\n方波信号的频谱：\n\n<center>\n\n![1-23.png](attachment:1-23.png)\n\n</center>\n\n{% endcut %}\n\n"
      ],
